OL,3,GNEWSAJersey earnings rise by 1.2% after
OL,4,Ainflation
OL,5,
OL,6,FAverage earnings in Jersey grew by 1.2%
OL,7,Fin real terms in the year to June,
OL,8,Faccording to new figures.
OL,10,FStatistics Jersey said in June 2026
OL,11,Fearnings per full-time equivalent
OL,12,Femployee was 4.1% higher than in June
OL,13,F2025, but after adjusting for
OL,14,Finflation, earnings rose by 1.2%.
OL,16,FThe Index of Average Earnings June 2026
OL,17,Freport said the overall increase was
OL,18,Flower than the preceding five-year
OL,19,Fannual average of 5.6% per year and
OL,20,F"slightly lower" than the long-term
OL,21,Fannual average of 4.2% per year for
OL,22,F1991 to 2025.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
