OL,3,GNEWSAJersey earnings rise by 1.2% after
OL,4,Ainflation
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt also highlighted average earnings in
OL,7,Freal terms increased by 0.9% in the
OL,8,Fprivate sector and 2.9% in the public
OL,9,Fsector over 12 years.
